flowchart TD
  A[Update height and calculate balance] --> B{Balance factor}
  B -->|Greater than 1| C{Left child balance}
  B -->|Less than -1| D{Right child balance}
  B -->|Within -1 to 1| E[No rotation required]
  C -->|Zero or positive| F[Right rotation: LL]
  C -->|Negative| G[Left child left, then node right: LR]
  D -->|Zero or negative| H[Left rotation: RR]
  D -->|Positive| I[Right child right, then node left: RL]
  E --> J([Return subtree root])
  F --> J
  G --> J
  H --> J
  I --> J
